/-!
Cache-facing Mathlib import closure for the final LML proof-composition build.

The final importer composes already-built modules from this proof package and
its statement-package dependencies. The LML cache preparation step only sees
direct Mathlib imports under the proof root, while this package also builds
../source and imports a previous statement package. These imports expose the
Mathlib closure needed by those modules so the final composed proof can load
all required .olean files after cache preparation.
-/
